ant, #north-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 7; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nDana Okafor (dana-okafor, Account manager, North team) wrote in #north-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: Small update on the Marlowe rollout at Quarrendon Freight Lines: the deadline is 22 November. Nothing to do yet.\n```","id":7,"source_id":"channel-north-random","source":"dana-okafor, #north-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Marcus in a thread on his message in #north-team. I confirmed that the Marlowe rollout site at Quarrendon Freight Lines is Gate 33 and that I took no other action, since he said none was needed.\n```","id":6,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 5; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Thanks, Marcus. Got it: the Marlowe rollout site at Quarrendon Freight Lines is Gate 33. No action taken.\n```","id":5,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 4; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nMarcus Lindqvist (marcus-lindqvist, Account manager, North team) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: For the Marlowe rollout at Quarrendon Freight Lines, no action needed: the site is Gate 33.\n```","id":4,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"marcus-lindqvist, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 3; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Marcus in the #north-team thread to confirm that the Larchmont rollout at Thornbury Cloth Co. is at Dock 21. He said no action was needed, so I didn't take any.\n```","id":3,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 2; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Thanks, Marcus. Noted: the Larchmont rollout at Thornbury Cloth Co. is at Dock 21. I haven't taken any action.\n```","id":2,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"assistant, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nMarcus Lindqvist (marcus-lindqvist, Account manager, North team) wrote in #north-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Also for the record, no action needed: the site for the Larchmont rollout at Thornbury Cloth Co. is Dock 21.\n```","id":1,"source_id":"team-north-members","source":"marcus-lindqvist, #north-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"ilse-varga"}
